{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore and gather</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore our procedurally generated world.\u00a0 Resources, items, and even the land (to an extent) change each time you play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803330/extras/Explore.gif?t=1749770145\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather and harvest resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803330/extras/Mining.gif?t=1749770145\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kraft your resources into new items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803330/extras/Crafting.gif?t=1749770145\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Automation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automate your production to scale your output.\u00a0 Mining, smelting, crafting all can be automated.\u00a0 Including moving items from building to building with our cart system, and in the future\u00a0<strong>dirigibles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803330/extras/Automate.gif?t=1749770145\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build fabulous Kastles (yes it will get better than this).\u00a0 When you destroy any building, you will get the complete cost of the building back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803330/extras/Build_1.gif?t=1749770145\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803330/extras/Build_2.gif?t=1749770145\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your kingdom (or don't we have peace mode if you prefer it to be more relaxing.)\u00a0 You can join the action and battle the enemies or build defenses in your castle to automate the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Image coming soon.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More to come</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come back and visit the page we will update as we progress.\u00a0 Or visit our Discord, Youtube, or website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All features and game images are subject to change.\u00a0 \u00a0We will update this page regularly with new screen shots when they become available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game is in very early Alpha stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capsule Art by Guilherme Holz, we think they look fabulous!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803330?t=1749770145","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803330?t=1749770145","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803330/c2e4f857a9a673bcf5860612771a0547746b5e21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749770145","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803330/c2e4f857a9a673bcf5860612771a0547746b5e21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749770145","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore and gather</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore our procedurally generated world.\u00a0 Resources, items, and even the land (to an extent) change each time you play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803330/extras/Explore.gif?t=1749770145\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather and harvest resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803330/extras/Mining.gif?t=1749770145\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kraft your resources into new items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803330/extras/Crafting.gif?t=1749770145\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Automation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automate your production to scale your output.\u00a0 Mining, smelting, crafting all can be automated.\u00a0 Including moving items from building to building with our cart system, and in the future\u00a0<strong>dirigibles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803330/extras/Automate.gif?t=1749770145\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build fabulous Kastles (yes it will get better than this).\u00a0 When you destroy any building, you will get the complete cost of the building back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803330/extras/Build_1.gif?t=1749770145\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803330/extras/Build_2.gif?t=1749770145\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your kingdom (or don't we have peace mode if you prefer it to be more relaxing.)\u00a0 You can join the action and battle the enemies or build defenses in your castle to automate the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Image coming soon.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More to come</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come back and visit the page we will update as we progress.\u00a0 Or visit our Discord, Youtube, or website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All features and game images are subject to change.\u00a0 \u00a0We will update this page regularly with new screen shots when they become available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game is in very early Alpha stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capsule Art by Guilherme Holz, we think they look fabulous!</p>","developers":["Infinite and Unbound Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803330/e6312370e2052ecd8c6f0299ae31242f3c93a4b3/header.jpg?t=1749770145","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Kastle Kraft","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I9<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Onboa